1.Create The enivroments 
    python -m venv .venv

2.Install Packages
    pip install aiogram google-genai python-dotenv

3.Collect all installed Packages
    pip freeze > requirements.txt

4.Create Enviroments Variables(.env)
    BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token
    GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key
5. Create git ignore(.gitignore)
    .venv/
    .env